(1. PURPOSE) Tj T*
(This procedure defines how internal audit is carried out at Northfield.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. SCOPE) Tj T*
(Applies to all internal audit activities in production and quality control at Northfield.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. RESPONSIBILITIES) Tj T*
(The process owner, Dev Okafor, maintains this procedure. Quality approves it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. PROCEDURE) Tj T*
(Step 1: Record the result against the acceptance criterion, and record the result on form F-242.) Tj T*
(Step 2: Inspect the second-person check.) Tj T*
(Step 3: Confirm the batch number.) Tj T*
(Step 4: Clean the logbook entry.) Tj T*
(Step 5: Document the equipment status label.) Tj T*
(Step 6: Escalate deviations to Quality within one day.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. RECORDS) Tj T*
(Records of internal audit are kept for five years after batch expiry.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
